module jev_generation_trace_lsp_projection

input generation_trace_status
input missing_stage
input missing_stage_index
input metric_digest
input evidence_prefix_digest
input trace_observation_digest
input read_only
input non_authorizing

status BOUND complete generation trace is shown as a clear read-only projection
status DEFERRED generation trace producer is deferred
status UNKNOWN missing generation trace evidence or an unsafe boundary is preserved

field publishable
field severity
field code
field observation_digest

constraint canonical_missing_stage_index
constraint read_only
constraint no_improvement_claim
constraint no_execution
constraint no_authorization
constraint no_edits
constraint no_command